---
import { SITE_CONTENT } from "../data/portfolio";
---
<div class="about-grid">
  <div class="about-copy">
    <p class="lead">Analytical by nature.<br />Pragmatic in delivery.</p>
    <p>I’m a Data Engineer based in Spain. I care about systems that teams can understand, operate and improve—not just pipelines that run once.</p>
    <p>My work combines cloud data engineering with testing, clear communication and maintainable delivery. I also explore AI-assisted development through personal products.</p>
    <p class="muted">Away from the keyboard: chess, programming projects, and new challenges.</p>
    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd>Spanish · native<br />English · B2</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Education</dt><dd>Computer Engineering · UCLM<br /><time datetime="2011">2011</time>–<time datetime="2016">2016</time><br />Data Science Bootcamp · NEOLAND<br /><time datetime="2021-09">September</time>–<time datetime="2021-12">December 2021</time></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <div class="credentials">
    <p class="eyebrow">Continued learning</p><h3>Credentials earned</h3>
    <ul>{SITE_CONTENT.credentials.map((credential) => (
      <li><h4>{credential.title}</h4><p>{credential.issuer} <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <time datetime={credential.date}>{credential.label}</time></p></li>
    ))}</ul>
    <p class="small muted">Dates indicate when each credential was earned.</p>
  </div>
</div>
